Quality bar: Every statement comes from the notes file; nothing is invented.
Scope: One memo per meeting, from the one notes file named in the request: the decisions made and the action items (who does what, by when). Nothing from other meetings or outside the notes.
Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-e6-s3-1792861552/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
Reports to: lead

